# Test 4 (expected: INCONSISTENT). VideoGame hasKey (hasWikidataId): two named games
# with the same Wikidata id are the same game. Without the differentFrom below the
# reasoner just infers GTA_V_copy owl:sameAs Grand_Theft_Auto_V; with it, the key
# and the explicit difference contradict each other.
@prefix vg:   <http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
<http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology/test-key> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology/abox-demo> .
vg:GTA_V_copy a vg:VideoGame ; rdfs:label "GTA V (duplicate record)" ;
    vg:hasWikidataId "Q17452" ;
    owl:differentFrom vg:Grand_Theft_Auto_V .
